      {
        "id": 17448,
        "title": "Params",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 147992,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Sometimes functions need specific information to help them perform their tasks. Like a function that adds an item to a player's inventory.</p><webview version=\"2\" content=\"&lt;!doctype html&gt;&#xA;&lt;html&gt;&#xA; &lt;head&gt;&#xA;  &lt;style&gt;&#xA;   body {&#xA;    text-align: center;&#xA;    height: 350px;&#xA;    font-size: 16px;&#xA;    margin: 0 auto;&#xA;    background-color: #0B1020;&#xA;    color: #E6E6E6;&#xA;    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;&#xA;   }&#xA;   button {&#xA;    width: 200px;&#xA;    height: 30px;&#xA;    font-size: 18px;&#xA;    border-radius: 5px;&#xA;    margin: 0 auto;&#xA;    display: block;&#xA;    color: black;&#xA;    outline: none;&#xA;   }&#xA;   h2 {&#xA;    text-align: center;&#xA;   }&#xA;   #inventoryList {&#xA;    text-align: left;&#xA;    width: 280px;&#xA;    margin: 0 auto;&#xA;   }&#xA;   input {&#xA;    width: 260px;&#xA;    height: 28px;&#xA;    font-size: 16px;&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/style&gt;&#xA; &lt;/head&gt;&#xA; &lt;body id=&quot;main&quot;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;h1&gt;Pick Up Loot&lt;/h1&gt;&#xA;  &lt;div class=&quot;Loot&quot;&gt;&#xA;   &lt;div class=&quot;itemInput&quot;&gt;&#xA;    &lt;input id=&quot;iInput&quot; type=&quot;text&quot; placeholder=&quot;Enter an item (e.g., Potion)&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&#xA;   &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;   &lt;button onClick=&quot;pickUp()&quot;&gt;Pick Up&lt;/button&gt;&#xA;   &lt;h3&gt;Inventory&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/div&gt;&#xA;  &lt;ul id=&quot;inventoryList&quot;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p id=&quot;full&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &lt;script&gt;&#xA;   let slotsUsed = 0;&#xA;   function pickUp() {&#xA;    if (slotsUsed &gt;= 3) {&#xA;     document.getElementById(&quot;full&quot;).innerHTML = &quot;Inventory Full&quot;;&#xA;    } else {&#xA;     const item = document.getElementById(&quot;iInput&quot;).value;&#xA;     let node = document.createElement(&quot;P&quot;);&#xA;     const textnode = document.createTextNode(&quot;Picked up: &quot; + item);&#xA;     node.appendChild(textnode);&#xA;     document.getElementById(&quot;inventoryList&quot;).appendChild(node);&#xA;     slotsUsed++;&#xA;    }&#xA;   }&#xA;  &lt;/script&gt;&#xA; &lt;/body&gt;&#xA;&lt;/html&gt;\" /></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 147993,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>For a start, we can use constants inside functions. Like creating <code> const item = \"Potion\";</code> and using it in the display statement.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"32\" /><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"37\" /><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"49\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"pickUpPotion\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" item = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Potion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Picked up: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + item);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"pickUpPotion();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>const</code> followed by <code>item</code> and then <code>=</code>, <code>\"Potion\"</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 147994,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>How would we pick up another item? We could create and call a new function <code>pickUpKey();</code> with similar code.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"114\" endIndex=\"125\" /><option startIndex=\"187\" endIndex=\"198\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"pickUpPotion\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" item = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Potion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Picked up: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + item);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"pickUpPotion();\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"pickUpKey\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" item = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Key&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Picked up: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + item);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"pickUpKey();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>pickUpKey()</code>, followed by <code>pickUpKey()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 147995,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Instead of writing two functions, we can pass specific information to just one function, without repeating code. Here's a peek.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"85\" endIndex=\"86\" /><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"89\" /><option startIndex=\"89\" endIndex=\"90\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"pickUp\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"item\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Picked up: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + item);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"pickUp(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Coin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"pickUp(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Key&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>\"</code>, followed by <code>Key</code>, and finally <code>\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 147996,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>To pass a value to a function, we first add a variable called a <strong>parameter</strong> inside the parentheses of the function. Here, we'll pass <code>item</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"pickUp\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"function\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"20\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"pickUp\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"item\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>item</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 147997,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>The parameter acts like a variable that stores a value. It doesn't have a value inside just yet though.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"57\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"pickUp\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"item\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Picked up: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + item);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>item</code>, followed by <code>item</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 147998,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>To pass a value for the variable, we place it between the parentheses when we call the function, like here with <code>pickUp(\"Gem\");</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"75\" /><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"76\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"pickUp\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"item\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Picked up: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + item);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"pickUp(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Gem&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>pickUp</code> followed by <code>(</code> and then <code>\"Gem\"</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 147999,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>How do we use variables inside functions?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">We use variables as normal inside functions</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">We aren't able to create new variables in functions</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">We use variables as normal inside functions.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 148000,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Why do we not want lots of code doing similar tasks?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Because it means we duplicate the same code</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Because we'll have lots of functions</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Because it means we duplicate the same code.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 148001,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Why do we pass specific information to functions?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">To avoid writing extra functions and duplicating code</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">To be able to call a function</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">To avoid writing extra functions and duplicating code.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 148002,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Where do parameters go?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Parameters go inside the parentheses of the function we're creating</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Parameters only go inside <code>console.log()</code> statements</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Parameters go inside the parentheses of the function we're creating.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 148003,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What does a parameter do?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">It acts as a special variable that stores a value</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">It makes it easier to duplicate code</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">It acts as a special variable that stores a value.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 148004,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>How do we pass a value for the parameter to the function?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">We call the function with the value between parentheses</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">We call the function and place the value directly afterward </item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">We call the function with the value between parentheses.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 148005,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Create the constant for use inside the function.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"37\" /><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"43\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"showHealth\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" health = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player Health: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + health);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"showHealth();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>const</code> followed by <code>health</code> and then <code>=</code>, <code>100</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 148006,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Complete the display statement.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"78\" endIndex=\"85\" /><option startIndex=\"85\" endIndex=\"86\" /><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"89\" /><option startIndex=\"102\" endIndex=\"108\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"gameState\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playing = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Playing&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" paused = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Paused&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;State: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + paused);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"gameState();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>console</code> followed by <code>.</code> and then <code>log</code>, <code>paused</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #16",
            "id": 148007,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Add the <code>state</code> parameter to the function.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"24\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"gameState\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"state\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;State: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + state);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"gameState(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Playing&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>state</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #17",
            "id": 148008,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Add the function name <code>addScoreBonus</code> and the parameter <code>score</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"29\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"addScoreBonus\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"score\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bonus = score / \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(bonus);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"addScoreBonus(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>addScoreBonus</code> followed by <code>(</code> and then <code>score</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #18",
            "id": 148009,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Call the <code>spawnEnemies()</code> function and pass the value <code>5</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"94\" /><option startIndex=\"95\" endIndex=\"96\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"spawnEnemies\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"count\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = count * \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"spawnEnemies(\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>spawnEnemies</code>, followed by <code>5</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #19",
            "id": 148010,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Call the <code>pickUp()</code> function and pass it the value <code>\"Shield\"</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"79\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"pickUp\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"item\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Picked up: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + item);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"pickUp(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Shield&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>pickUp(\"Shield\");</code>.</p></body></html>"
